# Burritos do not come back: picked up once in a session (or run), riding through the same spot
# again (three times, teleported back onto the central island) pays nothing more.
park soma
cmd 0 teleport 39.5 24.5 0.2 90
hold up 6..120
cmd 200 teleport 39.5 24.5 0.2 90
hold up 206..320
cmd 400 teleport 39.5 24.5 0.2 90
hold up 406..520
run 600
expect event burrito count == 1
expect event burrito{n=1,points=250} within 1..200
expect skater.score == 250 at end
expect no event bail
